OL,3,GNEWSALorry driver killed in crash on
OL,4,AGalloway coastal road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lorry driver has died after crashing
OL,7,Fon a coastal road in south-west
OL,8,FScotland.
OL,10,FThe accident involving a white DAF
OL,11,Florry happened at about 09:30 on
OL,12,FWednesday on the A716 near Drummore.
OL,14,FThe driver, a 56-year-old man who
OL,15,Fpolice have not yet named, was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FThe road was closed for several hours
OL,19,Fand police have appealed for any
OL,20,Fwitnesses, or anyone with dash-cam
OL,21,Ffootage, to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
